	)
	(text "E-stop: NC switch in a 5 V / 3 mA loop  (D-14)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.16 18.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c964e3d6-0bcf-47fb-9bbb-410f1677bab3")
	)
	(text "U3 rise: 0.55 x 2200 + 30 = about 1240 us/V,\nso about 6 ms to 5 V (C30 2.2n on CT).\nQOD on VOUT: the output is discharged when off.\nR32 holds LIDAR_EN (IO2, strapping) low at boot.\n470R and 2.2k: no back-feed either way (D-16).\nJ10 pin 1 (VCC) open: the adapter can't feed the lidar."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.066 194.056 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d1759128-4eba-450b-aa25-5061b2bbfba2")
	)
	(text "R41 20k up, a 10k B3950 NTC down (REVIEW C-07):\n-10 C reads 2.42 V, 25 C 1.10 V, 70 C 0.33 V.\nR42 1k / C36 100n filter it. U16 clamps J14's wire."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.414 241.554 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d9f718a6-bade-46ec-8362-95b6c34650d7")
	)
	(text "R39/R40: OUT x 0.69, at most\n2.27 V at GPIO36 (D-15).\nR35/R36: the bus pull-ups,\non this board only (SPEC 5).\n100R in each bus line; U12\nsits on the bus side (SPEC 6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 364.236 163.068 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ec18c88c-c46f-4a07-a3cc-e5c5b3f5894f")
	)
	(text "D10, D11: wired-AND (D-13). A board pulls its line low through its diode, R26/R27 pull it up to 3.3 V,\nand a powered board can't feed an unpowered controller. 1k in each TX line: at most 2.7 mA into an\nunpowered board (REVIEW C-12). U9, U10: VCC open (D-12). Grounds direct (D-18)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.066 102.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f129b0c2-2aed-4b09-875a-ebcec4ba31f1")
	)
